        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 4737,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 1902,
        "paragraph_id": "7B3878A8",
        "text": "The cell height at the center of the groundwater cells (ΔzH,i,j) is calculated from the groundwater level and the bottom of the aquifer in the center of the cell, whereas the cell heights at the horizontal cell interfaces are calculated using an upwind procedure:"
      }
    ],
