        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 1906,
        "paragraph_id": "323391EA",
        "text": "In (B.21) zaquifer is the level of the bottom of the aquifer. As described in Section 3.3.6, the head applied on the top boundary of the groundwater domain (Hbc) depends on whether the groundwater and surface water are connected or unconnected:"
